Forky – Meal Planner App

Last updated: 23.02.2026

We respect your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the Forky mobile application.

1. Information We Collect

Forky does not require user accounts and does not collect personal information such as names, email addresses, or passwords.

The App may collect limited, non-identifiable information automatically, including:

App usage data (features used, screens viewed)

Device information (device type, operating system)

Performance and crash data

This information is collected only for analytics and app improvement purposes and cannot be used to identify you personally.

2. Analytics

Forky uses third-party analytics services to understand how the App is used and to improve performance and user experience.

These services collect aggregated and anonymized data only.

3. Recipes & Third-Party Content

Forky displays recipes and meal information provided by third-party sources.

We do not create, verify, or control this content.

We do not collect personal data related to recipe usage.

We are not responsible for the privacy practices of third-party content providers.

4. Payments & Subscriptions

All payments and subscriptions are handled exclusively by Apple via the App Store.

Forky does not process or store any payment or billing information.

5. Push Notifications

Forky may send reminder notifications related to meal planning.
These notifications are optional and can be disabled in your device settings.

6. Data Storage

Some recipe data may be cached locally on your device to improve performance.
This data:

Is stored only on your device

Is not transmitted to Forky servers

Can be removed by uninstalling the App

7. Children’s Privacy

Forky is not intended for children under the age of 13.
We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

8. Your Rights (GDPR)

Since Forky does not collect personal data, there is no personal data to access, modify, or delete.
